    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19000" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαθμ-ίς</span></b> , ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>N.</u>
			5.1
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.428.4
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Mel.
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>step</i>
			or <i>threshold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρᾶν βαθμίδων ἄπο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>J.AJ</u>
				15.11.5
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασμίς.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>base, pedestal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>socket,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				2
			</span></i>: generally, <i>hollow</i> in a joint, ib.<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>.</div>
